{"id":"ENGL201","title":"The Medieval Imagination","department":"English","level":"Undergrad","credits":"3","description":"How and why do the Middle Ages resonate with us now? Explore a wide range of narratives, poems, artworks, and songs from ancient, medieval, and Renaissance cultures. Study popular culture, manuscript and print technologies, and the relationship between the sacred and the profane over a millenium. Learn about modern and contemporary medievalist revivals that might include authors such as J.R.R. Tolkien and N.K. Jemisin, television series such as Game of Thrones, and more.","gradingMethods":null,"noLongerOffered":false,"removedTerm":null,"removedDetected":null,"terms":[{"term":"201808","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":15,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Justine Decamillis"],"removed":false},{"term":"201908","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":15,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Garth Libhart"],"removed":false},{"term":"202008","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":15,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Garth Libhart"],"removed":false},{"term":"202108","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":18,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Halla Khalil"],"removed":false},{"term":"202208","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":30,"waitlist":0,"instructors":[],"removed":false},{"term":"202508","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Kellie Robertson"],"removed":false},{"term":"202608","sections":1,"seats":30,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Christopher Crane"],"removed":false}],"instructors":[{"name":"Garth Libhart","terms":2,"slug":"engl-garth-libhart"},{"name":"Christopher Crane","terms":1,"slug":"engl-christopher-crane"},{"name":"Halla Khalil","terms":1,"slug":"engl-halla-khalil"},{"name":"Justine Decamillis","terms":1,"slug":"engl-justine-decamillis"},{"name":"Kellie Robertson","terms":1,"slug":"engl-kellie-robertson"}]}